3. Commercial use
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

3.1 Commercial Use of the Software or of any Derivative Work is not permitted
under this License. A separate commercial license may be requested from the
Licensor through the project's official repository.

3.2 For clarity, the following are allowed under this License and are not
Commercial Use, as long as You do not charge for the Software or a Derivative
Work, or for access to it specifically:
  (a) playing Minecraft with the Software, alone or with others;
  (b) running a game server with the Software, including a server that earns
